{
  "id": "56",
  "title": "幽微赋",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“幽微赋”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "天地阴阳二气，降于春夏秋冬，各生其时；有用者则吉，无用者则凶。是以泄天机之妙理，谈大道之玄微。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-d529826006f0a257ea44-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "天既生人，人各有命。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-21e6fde95c8d2c1f23bc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "所以，早年富贵，八字运限咸和；中主孤单，五行逢死绝败。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-1af4ab4d558bf932e57e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "过房入舍，年月中分。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-cce1ce1b428f22e5e195-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "随母从夫，偏财空而印旺。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-bee5cf2da80da4666503-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "早岁父亡，偏财临死绝杀宫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-a7bf36a863d978144e58-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "幼岁母离，只为财多印死。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-d8a15e8f8ec3b01d27de-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "比肩多，而兄弟无情。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-813a76d097b6452f499d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳刃多，而妻宫有损。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-ce25acb753fbeac3b45e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官逢死气之方，子招难得。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-9e2edc6414d2f3340bd4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若见伤官太盛，子亦难留。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-5d06f279bf20dd980ef6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "如遇冲破提纲，定主离于祖业；再见空亡，三番四废。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-2cece775dcb874aa68d3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印綬逢生，母当贤贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-61dcc038f0b3e868209d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "偏官归禄，父必崢嶸。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-26e5b93a7bbf370ec62a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官星临禄旺之乡，子当荣显。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-1c938a42e37761883fc7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "七杀遇长生之位，女招贫夫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-25cc822b54f82bad6f78-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "自身借宫所生，必是依人过活。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-bb567afbc844974a2581-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "妻星失令，半路拋离；若乃借宫所生，亦是他人义女。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-71dcadd677d004303064-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "酒色猖狂，只是桃花带杀。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-53f3bb29b69faf526acf-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "慈祥敏慧，天月二德聚来。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-e244030aa0cbc5206219-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印綬旺，而子少息稀。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-0039d48defbd134c8d24-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "正官旺，而女多男少。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-c07a2147f698cd5d7abe-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "梟神兴，早年折夭。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-c86a00c8d6c5242d1dcb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "食神旺，老寿而高。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-bdcbbf0206cbd804ea8c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "偏财逢败，父主风流；子曜若临，破家荡产。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-b21aafe53d0e80750695-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "自身逢败，早岁兴衰。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-80e826681a2d3400a191-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "妻入墓，不得妻财。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-758943bc5faa58ffd687-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "父临库，父当先死。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-03343de1f72063b0b0b4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "比肩逢禄，兄弟名高。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-cd96d72e96159493eb0f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "食神多而好饮食。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-693bef62542c767ec3a5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "正官旺而受沾滋。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-8c200efe227f1390785c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身临沐浴之年，恐愁水厄。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-9a330f9e0576fe01b9c0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "生入斗剋之年，必逢火灾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-5e07ba9e66f011d4db83-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "女带桃花坐杀，定主淫奔。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-4042d0dc05af0dd39386-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤多而印綬被剋，母当淫荡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-4222e764c4239ea4e991-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "年月冲者，难为祖业。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-4a75323bd18b3e7f78a8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日时冲者，妻子招迟。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-e773154bf638a53a3568-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若见天元刑战，父母难靠；如遇地支所生，凶中成吉。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-33c95e9a480265e2c7fd-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日主弱，水火相战，而招是非。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-99c8833d2aecc009767f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲木衰，逢金旺，而无仁无义。此乃男命之玄机。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-4640b2ecac0d20481497-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "略说女人之奥妙，纯粹在于八字。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-d3d8e4d907a8788fd272-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "纯有富贵者，一官生旺。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-406a4321a38c09557ffb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱休囚，必为贵者。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-80ec3e4fad7ef84bbc00-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "浊淫者，五行冲旺。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-a5205ca913b58eaa00a6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "娼淫者，官杀交叉。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-cf1b9d8c09334f4230fb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "命主多合，此为不良。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-82a799f11b4933085c7a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "满柱杀多，不为剋制。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-72edb278a02141f80c96-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印綬多，而老无子。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-2f42aa407b53402aa59b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官旺，而幼伤夫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-e419a211f752274e65e1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "荒淫之慾，食神太过。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-16bd3176605b6479ab60-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱不见夫星，未为贞洁。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-32fb4bab62031dc97aac-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官星绝，遇休囚，孤孀独宿。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-d55433aebbdd77d76ad6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "清洁源流，金猪相遇。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-eca8c7112aca01976730-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "木虎相见，四柱三夫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-1c0da9f7be961dfbde39-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳刃重叠、水火逢蛇，夫宫早丧。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-2d24794b034ca35e7d5f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "食神一位逢生旺，招子须当拜圣明。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-c67ead72a9133ee7eaee-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "父母之宫，男命同断。若见此书，藏之如宝，若遇高士，对镜分明；依其此法，万无一失。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "56-69ab5df1c551b95e7a5d-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
